  id: coast
  includeInAll: 1
  description: Three holds over the Ligurian Sea with the coast in frame. The only
    benchmark that samples water - the ocean's sky reflection, the cloud deck seen
    in it, and the sun glint. Two at low sun, where the Fresnel term dominates, one
    at noon for contrast.
